!!Created:  ESE & HLB 06/09/95
!![1] 12/11/95 ESE - Packed half dozens incorrectly.
!![2] 12/12/95 ESE - Fixed zone checking for 500 wgt/alaska, etc.
!![3] 12/16/95 ESE - Fixed various bugs - packing too heavy on nets, wrong
!!                   packing if no alternate shipping and less boxes,
!!                   strange box destruction on some nets.
!![4] 12/18/95 ESE - Put zone in box record so invoices can print it.
!![5] 12/19/95 ESE - Caching problems fixed.
!![6] 12/19/95 ESE - Orders from cancel/replace would not have correct freight
!!                   as they set (for some reason) the manual flag.
!![7] 12/20/95 ESE - Kludge to fix invalid ATQT keys and allow posting.
!![8] 12/20/95 ESE - FIX: was smashing ATQT key on credit memos.
!!                 - NEW: do not abort if call tag aborted.
!![9] 12/20/95 ESE - FIX: old credits/cash not working if no boxes.
!![10] 12/21/95 ESE -FIX: caching made errors occasionally.  Hard abort
!!                   if boxes bad.
!![11] 12/21/95 ESE -FIX: still caching problems.
!![12] 01/02/96 ESE  FIX: esoteric problem with "cannot ind last box"
!![13] 01/04/96 ESE  NEW: add new company name display.
!![14] 01/04/96 ESE  FIX: infinite loop if failed credit and running direct.
!![15] 01/05/96 ESE  NEW: do not auto apply credits if credit card terms.
!!                   MUST have matching AR1OEU program.
!![16] 01/08/96 ESE  NEW: Better apply credits and cash.
!![17] 01/09/96 ESE  FIX: Allow call tags.
!![18] 01/16/96 ESE  NEW: Allow 100% free freight ...
!!                   Need: OEFRFR.TAB, OEFRF1.TAB, OEPCK1.TAB
!![19] 01/18/96 ESE/ROM NEW: Added new zip/zones in zone checking (1996 tables)
!![20] 02/09/96 ESE   FIX: edit [18] was wrong (signs don't match error).
!![21] 02/10/96 ESE   FIX: Delivery days printout.
!![22] 02/23/96 ESE/CAE NEW: Improved error messages
!![23] 03/05/96 ESE     NEW: Fudge tax on free freight if no ship total.
!![24] 03/06/96 ESE     FIX: Corrected false error message: Ship Via Weight
!!                           conversion not found with non-inventoried parts
!![25] 03/20/96 ESE     FIX: Conditional charges implemented.
!![26] 04/17/96 ESE     NEW: Invalidate weight if zero and abort!
!![27] 04/19/96 ESE     FIX: Not always finding credits to apply.
!![28] 04/24/96 ESE     FIX: By order charges not always working.
!![29] 04/25/96 ESE     FIX: "very weird" error.
!![30] 04/25/96 ESE     NEW: Allow pick ticket on all backordered order.
!![31] 04/25/96 ESE     NEW: minor change to [29] - may not matter!
!![32] 05/10/96 ESE     NEW: more hacking on above.
!![33] 05/16/96 ESE     NEW: Better error message if state is blank on LST.
!![34] 05/20/96 ESE     FIX: Not always using overflow percentage correctly.
!!                      Also, add via max weight.
!![35] 05/24/96 ESE     FIX: Autopack only bug.
!![36] 05/28/96 ESE     NEW: Die on invalid zip/zone cross ref error.
!![37] 06/10/96 ESE     FIX: make triple sure via changes bill via by
!!                      adding refchg to via tabc (should not matter).
!![38] 06/11/96 ESE     NEW: Allow 500 wgt different weight limits.
!!
!![39] 06/24/96 ESE     NEW: Error if too many boxes.
!!                      FIX: AUTOPACK was wrong if re-packed w/different qty.
!!                      NEW: Allow tax change.  IH: pack01.s required.
!!
!![40] 06/25/96 ESE/CAE FIX: 500 Weight was not looking at environment
!!                           variables
!![41] 06/26/96 ESE     FIX: probobly meaningless.
!!
!![42] 08/01/96  ESE    NEW: Add free freight by location.
!!
!![43] 08/09/96  ESE    FIX: Only on new free freight by location got subscript
!!                           out of range error.
!!
!![44] 08/13/96  ESE    NEW: Free freight on splits improved a lot!
!!
!![45] 08/29/96  ESE    NEW: Enable "customer zone" the new way.
!!
!![46] 09/16/96  ESE    FIX: First time through problem with special zones.
!!
!![47] 09/18/96  ESE    FIX: Invalid getnxt problem fixed (need current DB
!!                           as real fix in tabc.c) and fixed problem where
!!                           sometimes changing ship via did not change bill
