!                           so OEPACK was not updating it.
!  8.138  10/26/00 ese      Change to not calculate free freight by
!                           percentage if estimated wgt=estimated free
!                           wgt
!  8.139  11/30/00 ese      Split backorder as default option with an
!                           environment variable to make it act the old
!                           way. Clean up some error messages. Make it
!                           print the locations that can while skipping
!                           thise it cannot.
!  8.140  01/17/01 ese      Two major changes - handle oddball cases
!                           where number of boxes does not match
!                           estimate and it is a COD order (split
!                           estimated freight over actual boxes for
!                           purposes of billing) and look at first box
!                           flag in control record for autopacking.
!                           This second change requires that SLM change
!                           all UPS macros to look for the value
!                           properly.
!  8.141  01/19/01 ese      Two call tag problems -- weight not rounded
!                           up to nearest pound and declared value was
