!                           picking credit memo
!  8.143  01/23/01 cae      Added debug re: weight zero
!  8.144  02/06/01 slm      Was not setting BOX'VALUE'YN to Y if COD
!                           and one box. Look at value.bv[oe] to see
!                           how we determine which box has the value.
!                           If the customer is running AUTOPACK then we
!                           put the value in the highest value box. If
!                           not AUTOPACK, we put the value in box #1.
!                           MAXCOD.MAC uses the code in value.bv.
!  8.145  02/06/01 cae      Corrections to debug edit 8.143
